  TRANSFORM #1 PROJECTION (actual time=<time-range> rows=10000 loops=3)
  SINK #2 SORT_BUILD (actual time=<time-range> rows=10000 loops=3 spilled=true peak_memory_bytes=<bytes> spilled_bytes=<bytes>)
PIPELINE 1
  SOURCE #3 SORT_EMIT (actual time=<time-range> rows=10000 loops=6)
  SINK #4 CLIENT_RESULT (actual time=<time-range> rows=10000 loops=5)
